WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.700
[Birds outside]

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.023
<v You>What's the weather doing this afternoon?

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.371
<v Pucksley>Clearing by two. Take a jacket till then.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.031
<v You>Play some jazz in the kitchen.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.549
<v Pucksley>Jazz, in the kitchen.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.350
[Jazz plays, quietly]

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.000
[The puck is turned. The music grows]

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.415
<v You>Group the kitchen with the ensuite.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.232
<v Pucksley>Done. Both rooms.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.350
<v You>Set a timer for pasta. Ten minutes.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.670
<v Pucksley>Ten minutes. Starting now.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:32.650
[A chime]

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.230
<v Pucksley>Your pasta's ready.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.150
<v You>Turn off the downstairs TV.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.600
<v Pucksley>It's off.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.150
[Crickets]

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.600
<v You>Lamp on.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.250
<v You>Turn the heating up half a degree.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.488
<v Pucksley>Twenty-one and a half.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.650
<v You>Shut down the PC.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.308
<v Pucksley>Shut down the PC? Turn for yes.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.792
<v You>Everything off. Good night.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.800
<v Pucksley>Good night.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:04.400
[The music stops. Only the heating stays on]
